# Publish-only repository policy
# Ignore every root item by default, then allow only the static website and the
# small amount of repository metadata required for source control and Pages.
/*

# Website source: the repository root is the deployable document root.
!/*.html
!/assets/

# GitHub Pages automation and repository documentation.
!/.github/
!/.gitignore
!/.nojekyll
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md

# Never publish operating-system metadata, including files inside assets/.
**/Thumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini
**/.DS_Store
